.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt XKBWATCH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xkbwatch
.Nd XKB extension user utility
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     This program reports changes in the fundamental components of the XKB
     keyboard state plus the effective compatibility state.
.Ed
.Ss "OPTIONS"
.Bd -literal
     Xkbwatch accepts all of the standard X Toolkit command line options along
     with the additional options listed below:

     -version
             This option indicates that the program version should be printed,
             after which the program exits.
.Ed
.Ss "SEE ALSO"
.Bd -literal
     X(7)
.Ed
